<title>UK: Mexico sets 500 billion lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Mexico sets 500 billion lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +200 BP   PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BA2	 ISS PRICE  99.60     FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BB	  REOFFER    99.60</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	J.P. MORGAN IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
